The skill (skills/jev-browser-use/SKILL.md), its runner
(skills/jev-browser-use/scripts/jev_browser_agent.py) and the runner tests are derived from
the jev-browser-use skill in hermes-jev-skills by Steve Darlow, used under the MIT License:
https://github.com/kerpopule/hermes-jev-skills

Changes in this repository: caller-supplied typed values (--text, needs_text), key lookup
from the nearest .env and pi's secret file, the jev.browser_use_run_v1 result tag, and
Claude Code plugin / pi package manifests.

Jev Ultrafast (https://github.com/browser-use/jev-ultrafast, MIT, Browser Use) is not
included. The runner imports it from a separate checkout.
